{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "no-longer-human",
  "chunk_id": "no-longer-human-chunk-0160",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00160",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "我心不在焉地聽著他們倆交談。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I listened absentmindedly to the two of them talking.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00160",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "女人像是某家雜誌的記者，不久前好像約堀木畫過什麼插圖，是專程來取約稿的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The woman seemed to be a reporter from some magazine, and apparently she had commissioned Horiki not long before to draw some sort of illustration and had come especially to collect it.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00160",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "「雜誌急著用。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The magazine needs it urgently.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00160",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "「已經畫好了，早就畫好了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It is already finished, it has been finished for ages.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00160",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "這就是，你看一下吧。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Here it is, please take a look.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00160",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "這時，送來了一份電報。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Just then, a telegram was delivered.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00160",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "堀木看過後，喜笑顏開的面孔變得僵硬。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "After Horiki read it, his beaming face stiffened.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00160",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "「嗨，你小子在搞什麼呢？」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Hey, what on earth have you been doing?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00160",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "原來是比目魚發來的電報。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It turned out to be a telegram from Flounder.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00160",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "「總之，請你趕快回去。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Anyway, please go back right away.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00160",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "我要是能送你回去就好了，可現在我沒時間。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I wish I could take you back myself, but I do not have time now.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00160",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "你啊，離家出走，還一副滿不在乎的樣子。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You ran away from home, and yet you still look as if nothing matters.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00160",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "「您住在哪兒？」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Where do you live?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00160",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "「大久保。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Okubo.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00160",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "我脫口而出。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I blurted it out.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
